    "en": "Tartebz is a shop for unique, modern treats, focused on sour and sweet qamar al-din in a wide, high-quality range for every taste. Since we started in the Kingdom of Bahrain, we’ve combined traditional flavours with creative presentation to give our customers an unforgettable treat.",
